        "reasoning": "The three male age groups are disjoint and cover all males, so P(male)=0.16+0.30+0.24=0.70. This matches option b. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different question.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
