    "step-q143630": {
      "key": "step-q143630",
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-q143630",
        "name": "Question 3",
        "problem": "A certain disease is present in $500$ out of $100\\,000$ people in city $A,$ $800$ out of $200\\,000$ people in city $B,$ and $1\\,100$ out of $500\\,000$ people in city $C.$ What is the probability that a randomly selected person from any city has the disease?",
        "worked_solution": "Let $D$ be the event that a person has the disease, and\n\n- let $A$ be the event that the person is from city $A,$\n\n- let $B$ be the event that the person is from city $B,$\n\n- let $C$ be the event that the person is from city $C.$\n\nThen the disjoint union $A⊔B⊔C$ covers the entire sample space.\n\nTo calculate the probability that a randomly selected person has the disease, we use the law of total probability:\n\n$$\nP(D)=P(D\\cap A)+P(D\\cap B)+P(D\\cap C)\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that there are a total of \n\n$$\n100\\,000+200\\,000+500\\,000=800\\,000\n$$\n\npeople in all three cities.\n\n- To calculate $P(D\\cap A),$ we take the number of people in city $A$ who have the disease $(500)$ and divide by the total number of people in the three cities $(800\\,000).$ So, we have\n\n$$\nP(D\\cap A)=\\frac{500}{800\\,000}.\n$$\n\n- To calculate $P(D\\cap B),$ we take the number of people in city $B$ who have the disease $(800)$ and divide by the total number of people in the three cities $(800\\,000).$ So, we have\n\n$$\nP(D\\cap B)=\\frac{800}{800\\,000}.\n$$\n\n- To calculate $P(D\\cap C),$ we take the number of people in city $C$ who have the disease $(1\\,100)$ and divide by the total number of people in the three cities $(800\\,000).$ So, we have\n\n$$\nP(D\\cap C)=\\frac{1\\,100}{800\\,000}.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting the above information into the law of total probability, the probability that a randomly selected person from any city has the disease is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(D) & =P(D\\cap A)+P(D\\cap B)+P(D\\cap C) \\\\  & =\\frac{500}{800\\,000}+\\frac{800}{800\\,000}+\\frac{1\\,100}{800\\,000} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\,400}{800\\,000} \\\\  & =\\frac{24}{8\\,000} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{1\\,000}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
            "type": "radio",
            "choices": [
              {
                "option": "a",
                "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143630-a",
                "type": "math",
                "value": "\\frac{3}{1\\,000}",
                "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"69\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> "
              },
              {
                "option": "b",
                "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143630-b",
                "type": "math",
                "value": "\\frac{5}{900}",
                "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"70\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>900</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> "
              },
              {
                "option": "c",
                "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143630-c",
