      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "There are 0.45×200=90 green balls in total. Box C contains 90−20−30=40 green balls, so the probability is 40/200=20%, option e. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
