      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "The third machine produces 1−0.45−0.25=0.30 of the components. By the law of total probability, P(defective)=0.45×0.08+0.25×0.04+0.30×0.05=0.036+0.010+0.015=0.061, option e. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
