      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Model C3 accounts for 1−0.40−0.35=0.25 of the cars. By the law of total probability, P(breakdown)=0.40×0.06+0.35×0.04+0.25×0.02=0.024+0.014+0.005=0.043, option a. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
