t the car is of model <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"205\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>let <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"206\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> be the event that the car is of model <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"207\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>let <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"208\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> be the event that the car is of model <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"209\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Then the disjoint union <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"210\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2294\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2294\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.045em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊔</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⊔</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> covers the entire sample space.</p>\n<p>To calculate the probability that a randomly selected car will break down during the first year, we can use the law of total probability: </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"211\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 25.261em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx