      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Company C supplies 1−0.45−0.40=0.15 of the widgets. By the law of total probability, P(defective)=0.45×0.02+0.40×0.03+0.15×0.04=0.009+0.012+0.006=0.027, option c. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
        "confidence": 1,
