      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Let x be the probability a cap from plant C is white. The law of total probability gives 0.46=0.36×0.25+0.34×0.40+0.30x=0.226+0.30x. Hence x=(0.46−0.226)/0.30=0.78, option d. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
