      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Let x be the first-year breakdown probability for model M3. By total probability, 0.045=0.40×0.06+0.35×0.04+0.25x=0.038+0.25x. Thus x=0.007/0.25=0.028=2.8%, option c. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
        "confidence": 1,
