      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Each bag is selected with probability 1/3. If x is the green proportion in bag C, then 3/5=(1/3)(6/10+4/10+x)=(1+x)/3. Thus x=9/5−1=4/5, option a. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
            "correct_value": "\\frac{4}{5}",
            "correct_option": "a",
            "value_type": "math",
            "wrong_value": "\\frac{2}{5}",
            "correct_keys": [],
            "wrong_keys": [],
            "ma_value": null,
