      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Each bag is selected with probability 1/3. Let x be the green proportion in bag C. Then 2/5=(1/3)(8/20+6/20+x), so x=6/5−2/5−3/10=1/2, option b. No Math Academy answer or grade for this question is captured; the worked example concerns a different problem.",
