  "completed_at": 1791972499.703475,
  "history": {
    "task_id": "14199298",
    "task_type": "lesson",
    "topic_id": "971",
    "questions": [
      {
        "dom_id": "question-143560",
        "name": null,
        "problem": "Among the people arrested in a particular city in 2010, $16%$ were males under $18,$ $30%$  were males between $18$ and $40,$ and $24%$ were males over $40.$ What is the probability that a person randomly selected from all those arrested in 2010 is male?",
        "worked_solution": "Let $M$ be the event that a person selected was a male, and\n\n- let ${A}_{1}$ be the event that the person was under $18$,\n\n- let ${A}_{2}$ be the event that the person was between $18$ and $40$, and\n\n- let ${A}_{3}$ be the event that the person was over $40.$\n\nThen the disjoint union ${A}_{1}⊔{A}_{2}⊔{A}_{3}$ covers the entire sample space.\n\nTo calculate the probability that a randomly selected person is male, we use the law of total probability:\n\n$$\nP(M)=P(M\\cap {A}_{1})+P(M\\cap {A}_{2})+P(M\\cap {A}_{3})\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\nP(M\\cap {A}_{1})=0.16,\\,P(M\\cap {A}_{2})=0.3\\,P(M\\cap {A}_{3})=0.24.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting the above information into the law of total probability, the probability that a randomly selected person is male is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(M) & =P(M\\cap {A}_{1})+P(M\\cap {A}_{2})+P(M\\cap {A}_{3}) \\\\  & =0.16+0.3+0.24 \\\\  & =0.7.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [],
        "problem_field_keys": [],
        "answer_fields_complete": null,
        "result": "Correct",
        "proof_feedback": null,
        "html": "<div id=\"question-143560\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">1.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"143560\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Among the people arrested in a particular city in 2010, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> were males under <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  were males between <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"6\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> were males over <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"7\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> What is the probability that a person randomly selected from all those arrested in 2010 is male?  </p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 3:03 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:16</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
