        "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-143628\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">2.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"143628\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Mike has a total of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"20\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> candies divided into three bags. The first bag contains <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> mint-flavored candies, while the second bag contains <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"22\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> mint-flavored candies. If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"23\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of all of Mike's candies are mint-flavored, what is the probability that a randomly selected candy is a mint-flavored candy from the third bag? </p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 3:03 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:13</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
