g/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> What is the probability that a randomly selected person from any city has the disease?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 3:03 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:16</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
