dth=\"1121\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"310\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"5501\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6501,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1121\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"310\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-1010)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1334,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1121\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-3862)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1334,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1121\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"310\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"2695\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span>   </p>\n<p>Note the following: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>You may have noticed that there is an easier way to solve this problem. That is, to sum the total number of red roses <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"16.401ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 7061.4 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-26-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-26-Title\">(5+6+4 = 15)</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E26-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E26-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E26-MJMAIN-2B\" d=\"M56 237T56 250T70 270H369V420L370 570Q380 583 389 583Q402 583 409 568V270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H409V-68Q401 -82 391 -82H389H387Q375 -82 369 -68V230H70Q56 237 56 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E26-MJMAIN-36\" d=\"M42 313Q42 476 123 571T303 666Q372 666 402 630T432 550Q432 525 418 510T379 495Q356 495 341 509T326 548Q326 592 373 601Q351 623 311 626Q240 626 194 566Q147 500 147 364L148 360Q153 366 156 373Q197 433 263 433H267Q313 433 348 414Q372 400 396 374T435 317Q456 268 456 210V192Q456 169 451 149Q440 90 387 34T253 -22Q225 -22 199 -14T143 16T92 75T56 172T42 313ZM257 397Q227 397 205 380T171 335T154 278T148 216Q148 133 160 97T198 39Q222 2